            <ArticleTitle>Management of thyroid disorders in pregnancy: Recommendations made simple.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1452-1455</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review covers the current American Thyroid Association recommendations on diagnosis and management of thyroid disease during pregnancy and the postpartum period. It lists the recommendations in a reader-friendly way, and facilitates rational therapy of thyroid disorders, in relation to obstetric health, at the primary care level.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
